<DocsExample TExample="AccordionBasicExample" Title="Basic accordion" Description="Each NTAccordionItem is a native disclosure with a Label and optional SupportingText and LeadingIcon. Open starts an item expanded." />
<DocsExample TExample="AccordionLimitToOneExample" Title="Only one open at a time" Description="LimitToOneExpanded groups the items through a native details name, so opening one item closes the others. Give each accordion a unique GroupName." />
<DocsExample TExample="AccordionVariantsExample" Title="Variants and appearance" Description="Filled, Outlined and Elevated variants, Separated rounded rows, and the Compact appearance for dense lists." />
